</script></div></section><section class="section_results-v2 is-v2"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="results-v2_wrapper"><div class="results-v2_title-wrap"><h2 class="title-h2-new blue">The Results of Epigenetic Testing</h2></div><div class="results-v2_subtitle-wrap"><div class="text-regular is-dark">Example shown for illustrative purposes; not an actual patient result</div></div><div class="results-v2_content"><div data-current="Tab 1" data-easing="ease" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" class="results-v2_tabs w-tabs"><div class="results-v2_tabs-menu w-tab-menu" role="tablist"><a data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="results-v2_tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current" id="w-tabs-0-data-w-tab-0" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truage#w-tabs-0-data-w-pane-0" role="tab" aria-controls="w-tabs-0-data-w-pane-0" aria-selected="true"><div class="results-v2_tab-head"><div class="results-v2_tab-head-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5df6cbcf5561baa23de3f0_Avatar.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="results-v2_tab-head-img"></div><div class="results-v2_tab-head-content"><div class="results-v2_tab-head-title">PROACTIVE LONGEVITY</div><div class="results-v2_tab-head-text">Elena M.</div></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="results-v2_tab-link w-inline-block w-tab-link" tabindex="-1" id="w-tabs-0-data-w-tab-1" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truage#w-tabs-0-data-w-pane-1" role="tab" aria-controls="w-tabs-0-data-w-pane-1" aria-selected="false"><div class="results-v2_tab-head"><div class="results-v2_tab-head-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5df758dfaf827d52c757aa_Avatar.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="results-v2_tab-head-img"></div><div class="results-v2_tab-head-content"><div class="results-v2_tab-head-title">HEART HEALTH</div><div class="results-v2_tab-head-text">Robert K.</div></div></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="