em-results-v2-stats_item"><div class="item-results-v2-stats_list-title">BLOOD AGE</div><div class="item-results-v2-stats_list-value">+5 yrs</div><div class="item-results-v2-stats_list-value is-yellow">+2 yrs</div></div></div></div><div class="item-results-v2_left is-mobile"><div class="item-results-v2_text-wrap"><div class="item-results-v2_text mb24">Robert has had a borderline stress test and wants to know how old his cardiovascular system really is, not just his cholesterol number. He is looking for something concrete to hold himself accountable to.</div><div class="item-results-v2_title">HOW TRUDIAGNOSTIC MAY HELP</div><div class="item-results-v2_text mt8">TruAge SYMPHONYAge can break his aging down by organ system and reveal whether his heart age is running ahead of his calendar age. In a profile like Robert’s, that insight could guide care alongside his cardiologist, and repeat testing may show his heart age moving from several years ahead back toward his actual age.</div></div><div class="item-results-v2_cta-wrap"><a data-wf--global-cta-transparent--variant="full" href="https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/sign-in" class="cta-transparent w-variant-cc64accf-5b4f-aad9-61af-c2fc1b05ec90 w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular white cta">Start Testing</div><div class="cta-transparent-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
