iv class="item-results-v2-stats_item"><div class="item-results-v2-stats_list-title">IMMUNE AGE</div><div class="item-results-v2-stats_list-value">+1 yr</div><div class="item-results-v2-stats_list-value is-yellow">−2 yrs</div></div></div></div><div class="item-results-v2_left is-mobile"><div class="item-results-v2_text-wrap"><div class="item-results-v2_text mb24">Tyler is already fit but wants proof that his training and recovery choices are adding up to real biological benefit, not just aesthetics. He wants to optimize, not just maintain.</div><div class="item-results-v2_title">HOW TRUDIAGNOSTIC MAY HELP</div><div class="item-results-v2_text mt8">TruAge can let him benchmark his biological age, his organ systems through the SYMPHONYAge clocks, and his pace of aging against his training, and fine tune recovery if an organ system like immune age lags. In a profile like Tyler’s, consistent testing could show his aging speed trending down with each organ system tracking younger than his calendar age.</div></div><div class="item-results-v2_cta-wrap"><a data-wf--global-cta-transparent--variant="full" href="https://portal.trudiagnostic.com/sign-in" class="cta-transparent w-variant-cc64accf-5b4f-aad9-61af-c2fc1b05ec90 w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular white cta">Start Testing</div><div class="cta-transparent-icon w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
