<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
    const accq2 = document.querySelectorAll(".section_faq-with-image .item-faq-v2");
    accq2.forEach((accItem, index) => {
      const head = accItem.querySelector('.section_faq-with-image .item-faq-v2_head');
      const panel = accItem.querySelector('.section_faq-with-image .item-faq-v2_panel');
      // Генеруємо унікальний id для кожної панелі
      const panelId = `faq-panel-${index}`;
      panel.setAttribute('id', panelId);
      // Початкові aria-атрибути
      head.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      head.setAttribute('aria-controls', panelId);
      accItem.addEventListener("click", function () {
        const isActive = this.classList.toggle("active");
        panel.classList.toggle("active");
        head.classList.toggle("active");
        // Оновлюємо aria-expanded
        head.setAttribute('aria-expanded', isActive ? 'true' : 'false');
        if (panel.style.maxHeight) {
          panel.style.maxHeight = null;
        } else {
          panel.style.maxHeight = panel.scrollHeight + "px";
        }
      });
    });
  });
</script></div></section><section class="section_clocks is-v2 is-blue"><div class="padding-global new"><div class="container-new"><div class="clocks_wrapper"><div class="clocks_strapline-wrap"><div class="heading-xs-regular blue">SEAMLESS CLINIC WORKFLOW</div></div><div class="clocks_title-wrap"><h2 class="title-h2-new blue">How does TruAge work?</h2></div><div id="clocksSlider" class="clocks_slider swiper swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-pointer-events swiper-backface-hidden"><div class="clocks_list swiper-wrapper" id="swiper-wrapper-e34c4098713f13aa" aria-live="polite" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);"><div class="clocks_item swiper-slide swiper-slide-active" role="group" aria-label="1 / 3" style="margin-right: 24px;"><div class="clocks_item-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a6908edebbad95b88c1b3ea_How%20does%20trauge%20work%2001.png" loading="lazy" alt=""></div><div class="clocks_item-title-wrap"><h4 class="title-h4-v2 blue is-light">Order TruAge for Your Practice</h4></div><div class="text-regular light-blue">Register as a TruDiagnostic provider and order directly through the Provider Portal – either in bulk for clinic delivery or shipped directly to individual patients.</div></div><div class="clocks_item swiper-slide swiper-slide-next" role="group" aria-label="2 / 3" style="margin-right: 24px;"><div class="clocks_item-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a6908f9cf0b7544133c9197_How%20does%20trauge%20work%2002.png" loading="lazy" alt=""></div><div class="clocks_item-title-wrap"><h4 class="title-h4-v2 blue is-light">Patient Sample Collection</h4></div><div class="text-regular light-blue">Each test includes a simple finger-stick blood collection that takes approximately 3 minutes. Patients follow the enclosed instructions and return their sample via USPS drop-off using the prepaid materials provided.</div></div><div class="clocks_item swiper-slide" role="group" aria-label="3 / 3" style="margin-right: 24px;"><div class="clocks_item-image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a690902b7542dce41e5590a_How%20does%20trauge%20work%2003.png" loading="lazy" alt=""></div><div class="clocks_item-title-wrap"><h4 class="title-h4-v2 blue is-light">Receive Actionable Results</h4></div><div class="text-regular light-blue">Results are available in your Provider Portal within 2–4 weeks from the date the lab receives the sample, including biological age, organ system–level ages, and aging speed, ready to review with your patient.</div></div></div><span class="swiper-notification" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_developed is-v2"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="developed_layout"><div class="developed_title-wrap is-v2"><h2 class="title-h2-new blue">The Aging Clocks of TruAge</h2></div><div class="developed_list"><div class="developed_wrapper is-white"><div class="developed_content"><div class="developed_strapline-wrap"><div class="developed_strapline is-dark">DEVELOPED WITH HARVARD</div></div><div class="developed_title-wrap"><h2 class="title-h2-new is-light">Biological Age</h2></div><div class="developed_tag-wrapper"><div class="developed_tag">OMICmAge™</div></div><div class="developed_text-wrap"><p class="developed_text is-dark">The OMICmAge™ algorithm is one of the most precise and comprehensive methods for measuring biological aging. Its multi-omic approach analyzes proteins, metabolites, and clinical biomarkers to reveal the true state of the body’s aging process — and the factors accelerating or decelerating it — empowering you to optimize patient health and potentially slow aging.</p></div><div class="developed_cta-wrap"><a data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant="modify" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/omicmage" class="cta-yellow w-variant-927ae097-63d8-7236-ec7b-a65ed4a0b41b w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular blue cta">Learn More</div><div class="cta-yellow-icon w-variant-927ae097-63d8-7236-ec7b-a65ed4a0b41b w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
