</div></a></div></div><div class="developed_image"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6690e254f4f07d1a469bb330/6a5e00dad473cee1365783df_Image.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="developed_img"></div></div><div class="developed_wrapper is-full-blue"><div class="developed_content"><div class="developed_strapline-wrap"><div class="developed_strapline">DEVELOPED BY DUKE AND COLUMBIA</div></div><div class="developed_title-wrap"><h2 class="title-h2-new is-light">Aging Speed</h2></div><div class="developed_tag-wrapper"><div class="developed_tag">DunedinPACE™</div></div><div class="developed_text-wrap"><p class="developed_text">The DunedinPACE™ algorithm measures the rate at which the body is aging, providing a clear picture of whether you’re aging faster, slower, or as expected for your calendar age. It’s ideal for tracking the effectiveness of lifestyle and protocol interventions over time — regular monitoring shows how lifestyle and other interventions may impact biological age, giving patients the data and motivation to stay on track.</p></div><div class="developed_cta-wrap"><a data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant="modify" href="https://www.trudiagnostic.com/dunedin-pace" class="cta-yellow w-variant-927ae097-63d8-7236-ec7b-a65ed4a0b41b w-inline-block"><div class="text-regular blue cta">Learn More</div><div class="cta-yellow-icon w-variant-927ae097-63d8-7236-ec7b-a65ed4a0b41b w-embed"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
